# Setup sacrifices a Haywire Mite and exiles a Lotus Petal to leave a second own creature and a noncreature in Bot1's graveyard for chapter-III refusals; the Mite's dies trigger gains 2 life.
# Chapter I makes both Elves die; chapter II raises life to 25 while the Saga has two lore counters, before chapter III returns Bot1's Elf (CR 701.14, 714.2b, 714.4).
